<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News ADR common cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News ADR common cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has downgraded News Corp Ltd common American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) to its recommended list from its priority list, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The change does not affect preferred ADRs, which remain on the priority list.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 22-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
